This repository is an experimental visualization workstream maintained under `ndrorchestration`.
It provides interactive 3D visualization for modeled state, governance/evaluation data, drift trajectories, phi-harmonic/modal concepts, and related rendering experiments where implemented.

Historical DGAF, Agent Amethyst, COLLEEN, and other ecosystem labels are provenance vocabulary only. They do not establish autonomous governance, certification, production deployment, mathematical validity, scientific validity, or cross-repository evidence transfer.

Related repositories:
  - DGAF-Framework: https://github.com/ndrorchestration/DGAF-Framework
  - Driftwatch: https://github.com/ndrorchestration/Driftwatch
  - junior-apogee-app: https://github.com/ndrorchestration/junior-apogee-app

Current implementation and evidence must be evaluated from this repository's source, CI, and dated external/runtime evidence where available.

